34	// "Task"), and the "TodoWrite" tool was disabled by default in v2.1.142 in favor
35	// of the Task* tools. "TaskCreate|TaskUpdate" is a matcher list of exact tool
36	// names (Claude Code treats a matcher containing only letters/digits/_/-/spaces/
37	// ,/| as exact strings, not a regex). See:
38	//   - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/tools-reference.md (Agent, TodoWrite entries)
39	//   - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks.md (matcher evaluation rules)
40	//
41	// Configs written by older CLI versions used the outdated matchers "Task" and
42	// "TodoWrite", where the hooks silently never fired. Those are not rewritten in
43	// place on a normal `entire enable`; run with --force to strip and reinstall.
